{"seq":1,"slug":"indexes-btree","title":"索引与 B+ 树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/access-methods/indexes-btree","wordCount":1526,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"索引与-b-树\">索引与 B+ 树</h1><p>翻一本没有目录的千页词典找某个词，你得一页页扫；有了按字母排序的索引页，几次跳转就定位到了。数据库索引干的是同一件事，而几乎所有关系型数据库——PostgreSQL、MySQL/InnoDB、SQLite、Oracle——的默认索引结构都是 B+ 树，而不是二叉搜索树、哈希表或跳表。这不是巧合：B+ 树的结构恰好契合「磁盘按页读取、随机 I/O 昂贵」这个硬件现实。这一篇讲清 B+ 树为何如此，它的查找与维护代价，以及在写密集场景下挑战它的 LSM 树。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>B+ 树是一棵多路平衡搜索树。每个节点占一个磁盘页（典型 8KB 或 16KB），能容纳成百上千个键，因此树非常「矮胖」——几层就能索引上亿行。它有两个关键设计：所有真实数据（或指向数据的指针）只存在叶子层，内部节点只存导航键；叶子节点之间用指针串成有序链表，方便范围扫描。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    R[根节点&lt;br/&gt;键: 30 60] --&gt; A[内部&lt;br/&gt;键: 10 20]&#10;    R --&gt; B[内部&lt;br/&gt;键: 40 50]&#10;    R --&gt; C[内部&lt;br/&gt;键: 70 80]&#10;    A --&gt; L1[叶: 5 8 10]&#10;    A --&gt; L2[叶: 15 20 25]&#10;    B --&gt; L3[叶: 35 40 45]&#10;    L1 -.有序链表.-&gt; L2&#10;    L2 -.有序链表.-&gt; L3\">flowchart TD\n    R[根节点&lt;br/&gt;键: 30 60] --&gt; A[内部&lt;br/&gt;键: 10 20]\n    R --&gt; B[内部&lt;br/&gt;键: 40 50]\n    R --&gt; C[内部&lt;br/&gt;键: 70 80]\n    A --&gt; L1[叶: 5 8 10]\n    A --&gt; L2[叶: 15 20 25]\n    B --&gt; L3[叶: 35 40 45]\n    L1 -.有序链表.-&gt; L2\n    L2 -.有序链表.-&gt; L3</pre><p>为什么不用二叉树？下表对比常见索引结构在数据库场景的表现。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>点查</th>\n<th>范围查</th>\n<th>磁盘友好</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二叉搜索树</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_2 n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>差（树太高）</td>\n<td>内存数据结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希表</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>纯等值查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B+ 树</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_B n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>优（叶链表）</td>\n<td>优（按页对齐）</td>\n<td>通用 OLTP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LSM 树</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 摊还</td>\n<td>中（需合并）</td>\n<td>优（顺序写）</td>\n<td>写密集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是-b-树而非二叉树\">为什么是 B+ 树而非二叉树</h2><p>关键在树高。二叉树每个节点只有 2 个分支，索引 10 亿行需要约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 10^9 \\approx 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0582em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 层；每层都可能是一次磁盘随机 I/O，30 次随机读慢得无法接受。B+ 树每个节点扇出（fanout）可达上千，索引同样 10 亿行只需：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>1000</mn></msub><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = \\lceil \\log_B n \\rceil = \\lceil \\log_{1000} 10^9 \\rceil = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1000</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是三层。三次磁盘读就能定位任意一行，而且上层节点常驻内存缓存，实际磁盘 I/O 往往只有一两次。扇出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 越大树越矮，所以 B+ 树把节点大小对齐到磁盘页，让一次 I/O 读回尽可能多的键。这就是「磁盘友好」的全部秘密：用空间换层数，用层数换 I/O 次数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"范围查询与叶子链表\">范围查询与叶子链表</h2><p>B+ 树相对纯 B 树的改进，是把所有数据下沉到叶子层并用链表横向串联。这让范围查询 <code>WHERE age BETWEEN 30 AND 40</code> 变得极快：先自顶向下定位到 30 所在的叶子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_B n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），然后沿叶子链表顺序扫描直到超过 40，全程不再回到上层。顺序扫描叶子还是顺序 I/O，比随机 I/O 便宜得多。</p>\n<p>这个特性直接决定了优化器的访问路径选择：一个能用索引有序性的范围查询或 <code>ORDER BY</code>，可能让优化器选索引扫描以省去额外排序。具体如何选见 <a href=\"scan-methods\">扫描与访问路径</a>，而索引扫描的代价公式在 <a href=\"../foundations/cost-model\">代价模型与基数估计</a> 已给出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚簇索引-二级索引与回表\">聚簇索引、二级索引与回表</h2><p>索引和数据的关系有两种组织方式。聚簇索引（如 InnoDB 的主键）让 B+ 树的叶子直接存放整行数据，主键查询一步到位。二级索引的叶子则只存「被索引列 + 主键值」，按二级索引找到主键后，还要拿主键回聚簇索引再查一次完整行——这个动作叫回表。</p>\n<p>回表是随机 I/O，数量多了很贵。这就引出覆盖索引（covering index）的优化：如果查询要的列全都在二级索引里（<code>SELECT name WHERE name = ...</code> 且索引含 name），就不必回表，索引自身就能满足查询。优化器识别到覆盖索引时会标记为 Index Only Scan，代价大幅下降。</p>\n<h2 id=\"b-树的维护与-lsm-树的挑战\">B+ 树的维护与 LSM 树的挑战</h2><p>B+ 树的查询很美，但写入有代价。插入一行要找到对应叶子并写入，叶子满了就要分裂（split），分裂可能向上传播；删除可能触发合并。这些都是随机写，且每次更新都要原地改页，写放大明显。</p>\n<p>正因如此，写密集场景（事件日志、时序、IoT 遥测）近年大量转向 LSM 树（log-structured merge tree）。LSM 把写入先缓冲在内存的有序结构里，攒够一批再顺序刷成磁盘上的不可变文件（SSTable），后台再异步合并。顺序写远快于随机写，据 2026 年的工程实践对比，写密集负载下 LSM 的写吞吐可达 B+ 树的 5–10 倍。代价是读放大：一个键可能散落在多个层级的文件里，点查要逐层找，范围扫描还要归并多个文件，比 B+ 树叶子链表的连续扫描更费劲。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>B+ 树</th>\n<th>LSM 树</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>写入方式</td>\n<td>原地随机写</td>\n<td>顺序追加 + 后台合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写放大</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读放大</td>\n<td>低（定位精确）</td>\n<td>较高（多层查找）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围扫描</td>\n<td>优（叶链表）</td>\n<td>中（需归并）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表系统</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL、InnoDB</td>\n<td>RocksDB、Cassandra</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CockroachDB 这类系统在底层用 LSM 存储、却在 SQL 层提供接近 B+ 树的语义，正是想兼得两者之长。选哪种，本质是读写比例的权衡——这与优化器选扫描方式是同一种「按负载特征算代价」的思维。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>B+ 树是多路平衡树，节点对齐磁盘页、扇出极大，索引上亿行只需三层，把磁盘 I/O 压到极低。</li>\n<li>相比二叉树用层数换 I/O，相比哈希表多了范围查询能力，靠的是叶子层下沉 + 有序链表。</li>\n<li>聚簇索引叶子存整行，二级索引需回表；覆盖索引能避免回表，触发 Index Only Scan。</li>\n<li>B+ 树写入有分裂/合并和写放大的代价，写密集场景促成了 LSM 树的流行。</li>\n<li>LSM 用顺序写换高写吞吐（5–10 倍），代价是读放大，选型本质是读写比例的权衡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"索引与 B+ 树","id":"索引与-b-树"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么是 B+ 树而非二叉树","id":"为什么是-b-树而非二叉树"},{"level":2,"text":"范围查询与叶子链表","id":"范围查询与叶子链表"},{"level":2,"text":"聚簇索引、二级索引与回表","id":"聚簇索引-二级索引与回表"},{"level":2,"text":"B+ 树的维护与 LSM 树的挑战","id":"b-树的维护与-lsm-树的挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代价模型与基数估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/foundations/cost-model"},"next":{"title":"扫描与访问路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/access-methods/scan-methods"}}